[
  {
    "id": "v00",
    "start": 0,
    "end": 4.2,
    "window": 4.2,
    "text": "一个国家欠债太多，到底会发生什么？",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 3.456,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v01",
    "start": 4.2,
    "end": 8,
    "window": 3.8,
    "text": "很多人最关心的问题只有一个：",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 2.784,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v02",
    "start": 8,
    "end": 12,
    "window": 4,
    "text": "我的存款、工资，会不会跟着遭殃？",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 3.48,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v03",
    "start": 12,
    "end": 15.5,
    "window": 3.5,
    "text": "首先要分清两件事：内债和外债，",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 5,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 3.24,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v04",
    "start": 15.5,
    "end": 18,
    "window": 2.5,
    "text": "结局完全不一样。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 1.992,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v05",
    "start": 18,
    "end": 21.5,
    "window": 3.5,
    "text": "内债，说白了就是欠自己国民的钱，",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 10,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 3.216,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v06",
    "start": 21.5,
    "end": 24.5,
    "window": 3,
    "text": "国债、地方债都属于这类，",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 2.808,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v07",
    "start": 24.5,
    "end": 27,
    "window": 2.5,
    "text": "钱还在国内循环。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 2.136,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v08",
    "start": 27,
    "end": 31,
    "window": 4,
    "text": "外债，是欠别的国家、海外资本的钱，",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 3.72,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v09",
    "start": 31,
    "end": 33.5,
    "window": 2.5,
    "text": "要用外币偿还，",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 1.896,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v10",
    "start": 33.5,
    "end": 40,
    "window": 6.5,
    "text": "这才是风险最高的一种。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 2.52,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v11",
    "start": 40,
    "end": 43.5,
    "window": 3.5,
    "text": "第一种情况，也是大部分大国的选择：",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 3.168,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v12",
    "start": 43.5,
    "end": 47,
    "window": 3.5,
    "text": "慢慢拖、慢慢消化。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 2.424,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v13",
    "start": 47,
    "end": 51,
    "window": 4,
    "text": "通过长期通胀、缓慢增长、收税，",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 3.624,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v14",
    "start": 51,
    "end": 55,
    "window": 4,
    "text": "用未来的收入稀释债务。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 2.736,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v15",
    "start": 55,
    "end": 58.5,
    "window": 3.5,
    "text": "这个阶段不会瞬间崩盘，",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 2.664,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v16",
    "start": 58.5,
    "end": 62,
    "window": 3.5,
    "text": "但代价藏在细节里：",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 2.208,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v17",
    "start": 62,
    "end": 64.5,
    "window": 2.5,
    "text": "物价悄悄涨，",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 1.704,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v18",
    "start": 64.5,
    "end": 67,
    "window": 2.5,
    "text": "钱购买力慢慢变弱，",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 2.232,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v19",
    "start": 67,
    "end": 74,
    "window": 7,
    "text": "存款利息跑不赢通胀。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 2.664,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v20",
    "start": 74,
    "end": 77,
    "window": 3,
    "text": "第二种，外债爆雷，",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 2.208,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v21",
    "start": 77,
    "end": 80.5,
    "window": 3.5,
    "text": "也是新闻里看到的经典债务危机。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 5,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 3.168,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v22",
    "start": 80.5,
    "end": 83,
    "window": 2.5,
    "text": "外汇储备不够还债，",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 2.184,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v23",
    "start": 83,
    "end": 85.5,
    "window": 2.5,
    "text": "外资疯狂跑路，",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 1.872,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v24",
    "start": 85.5,
    "end": 88.5,
    "window": 3,
    "text": "本国货币大幅贬值。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 2.304,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v25",
    "start": 88.5,
    "end": 91,
    "window": 2.5,
    "text": "进口商品直接涨价，",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 2.304,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v26",
    "start": 91,
    "end": 94.5,
    "window": 3.5,
    "text": "油价、粮食、原材料全部变贵。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 10,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 3.264,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v27",
    "start": 94.5,
    "end": 97,
    "window": 2.5,
    "text": "这时你手里的现金存款，",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 15,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 2.328,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v28",
    "start": 97,
    "end": 99.5,
    "window": 2.5,
    "text": "哪怕数字没变，",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 1.872,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v29",
    "start": 99.5,
    "end": 103,
    "window": 3.5,
    "text": "能买到的东西直接变少；",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 2.616,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v30",
    "start": 103,
    "end": 105.5,
    "window": 2.5,
    "text": "企业成本暴涨，",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 1.824,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v31",
    "start": 105.5,
    "end": 110,
    "window": 4.5,
    "text": "裁员、降薪变多。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 2.208,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v32",
    "start": 110,
    "end": 113.5,
    "window": 3.5,
    "text": "第三种，直接选择债务违约，",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 2.928,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v33",
    "start": 113.5,
    "end": 116,
    "window": 2.5,
    "text": "简单讲就是公开说：",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 2.088,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v34",
    "start": 116,
    "end": 119,
    "window": 3,
    "text": "我暂时还不上钱了。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 2.184,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v35",
    "start": 119,
    "end": 122,
    "window": 3,
    "text": "短期海外债主损失最大，",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 2.64,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v36",
    "start": 122,
    "end": 125.5,
    "window": 3.5,
    "text": "本国会被国际资本市场拉黑，",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 3.072,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v37",
    "start": 125.5,
    "end": 128,
    "window": 2.5,
    "text": "很难再借钱。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 1.776,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v38",
    "start": 128,
    "end": 131,
    "window": 3,
    "text": "国内容易伴随股市大跌、",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 2.616,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v39",
    "start": 131,
    "end": 133.5,
    "window": 2.5,
    "text": "银行流动性紧张，",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 2.064,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v40",
    "start": 133.5,
    "end": 137,
    "window": 3.5,
    "text": "存款恐慌挤兑的风险上升。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 2.928,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v41",
    "start": 137,
    "end": 140,
    "window": 3,
    "text": "但大国走到这一步的概率极低，",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 5,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 2.76,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v42",
    "start": 140,
    "end": 144,
    "window": 4,
    "text": "代价太大。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 1.536,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v43",
    "start": 144,
    "end": 146.5,
    "window": 2.5,
    "text": "回到最开始的问题：",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 2.04,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v44",
    "start": 146.5,
    "end": 150.5,
    "window": 4,
    "text": "国家欠债多，普通人一定会遭殃吗？",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 3.408,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v45",
    "start": 150.5,
    "end": 153.5,
    "window": 3,
    "text": "不一定，要看是内债还是外债、",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 15,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 2.76,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v46",
    "start": 153.5,
    "end": 156.5,
    "window": 3,
    "text": "债务节奏能不能稳住。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 2.424,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v47",
    "start": 156.5,
    "end": 159.5,
    "window": 3,
    "text": "但风险来临时，最先受伤的，",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 10,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 2.784,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v48",
    "start": 159.5,
    "end": 162,
    "window": 2.5,
    "text": "往往是只拿着大量现金、",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 20,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 2.256,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v49",
    "start": 162,
    "end": 164,
    "window": 2,
    "text": "单一资产的人。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 1.824,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v50",
    "start": 164,
    "end": 166,
    "window": 2,
    "text": "债务本身不是洪水猛兽，",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 40,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 1.848,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v51",
    "start": 166,
    "end": 168,
    "window": 2,
    "text": "失控的债务才是。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 0,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 1.848,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v52",
    "start": 168,
    "end": 170,
    "window": 2,
    "text": "大国债务的消化周期很长，",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 50,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 1.872,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v53",
    "start": 170,
    "end": 172,
    "window": 2,
    "text": "很少瞬间崩塌，",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 5,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 1.848,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v54",
    "start": 172,
    "end": 173.5,
    "window": 1.5,
    "text": "但它的影响，",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 20,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 1.392,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v55",
    "start": 173.5,
    "end": 175.2,
    "window": 1.7,
    "text": "会慢慢渗透到物价、利息",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 50,
    "atempo": 1.279,
    "dur": 1.62,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v56",
    "start": 175.2,
    "end": 176.6,
    "window": 1.4,
    "text": "和你的收入里。",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 40,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 1.272,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v57",
    "start": 176.6,
    "end": 178,
    "window": 1.4,
    "text": "下一期，我们聊聊，",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 50,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 1.368,
    "fit": true
  },
  {
    "id": "v58",
    "start": 178,
    "end": 180,
    "window": 2,
    "text": "为什么有的国家敢一直借钱？",
    "voice": "zh-CN-YunyangNeural",
    "rate": 50,
    "atempo": 1.0,
    "dur": 1.944,
    "fit": true
  }
]